    "title": "Moon Touch",
    "description": "Hello everyone! I'm glad you're following my work.\r\n\r\n- How do I change the wallpaper color? --\r\n\r\nWallpaper Engine has a built-in feature called \"Show Color Settings.\" Your translation may differ slightly. This feature is located under the preview of my work in the app itself. Clicking on this line reveals four sliders that control the tint, color, and brightness of the work. You need the \"Tint\" slider. This will allow you to change the color of the work.\r\n\r\n- How do I change the effects of my work? --\r\n\r\nUnder my preview, specifically in the \"Color Settings\" section I mentioned above, there's a list of effects with blue squares next to them. Clicking on them toggles specific effects on and off.",
